{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out for gatherings, private sessions, and membership inquiries in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6fbfb; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7176; --accent:#4b7d74; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px; --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(15,23,24,0.08);
      --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, "Roboto Mono", "Segoe UI Mono", monospace;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#eef7f6); color:#10201f; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 36px;background:transparent}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .mark{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#7fb9ad);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--mono)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:26px}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e5eceb;font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .alt{background:#eef8f7;border:1px solid #e0f0ec;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    .support{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:24px}
    .testimonial{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .quote{flex:1}
    .quote p{margin:0 0 8px;font-style:italic}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .badge-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .cred-badge{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7fffd);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #e9f3ef;font-weight:700;cursor:default;position:relative}
    .cred-badge:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);transition:transform .18s}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#0b2b28;color:white;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .12s}
    .cred-badge[data-show="true"] .tooltip{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .plan{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff, #fbfffe);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e7f3f0}
    .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin:6px 0}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;background:#eaf6f4;padding:4px;border:1px solid #d7eeea}
    .toggle button{padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:none;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .toggle button.active{background:#cfeee6}

    /* contraindications */
    .notice{background:#fff6f6;border-left:4px solid #ffb3b3;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:18px;color:#6b2a2a}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 28px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav{display:none}
      header{padding:16px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="mark">SB</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="/events.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="/private-sessions.html">Private Sound</a>
      <a href="/pricing.html">Memberships</a>
      <a href="/about.html">Our Methods</a>
      <a href="/faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <h1 id="contact-heading">Contact and welcome</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach a member of the team to explore gatherings, private sessions or steady membership options in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. We’ll guide scheduling and practical details with clarity and care.</p>

        <form action="#" method="post" aria-describedby="contact-support" style="margin-top:10px">
          <div class="contact-grid">
            <div>
              <label for="name">Full name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="city">City</label>
              <input id="city" name="city" placeholder="{{CITY}}" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <label for="reason">What can we help with?</label>
            <select id="reason" name="reason">
              <option>Upcoming public gatherings</option>
              <option>Private sound session</option>
              <option>Membership & pricing</option>
              <option>Accessibility or contraindication note</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Briefly tell us what you hope for or any medical concerns"></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="actions">
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Send request</button>
            <button class="alt" type="button" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <div class="support">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div id="contact-support" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">We reply within 48 hours on business days. For urgent scheduling call the number above.</div>

        <div class="notice" role="note" aria-label="Contraindications">
          Important: Sound immersion can be intense. If you are pregnant, have a history of seizures, uncontrolled hypertension, recent head injuries, or psychiatric conditions with a history of psychosis, consult a medical provider before attending. If you use any implanted medical device or have concerns about vibrational therapy, please disclose this during booking.
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class="panel">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Quick connections</div>
            <div style="font-weight:800">Schedule • Ask • Join</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Proof gallery -->
        <div class="proof" aria-live="polite">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Community notes</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button id="prevTest" aria-label="Previous testimonial">◀</button>
              <button id="nextTest" aria-label="Next testimonial">▶</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="testimonial">
            <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f7f4,#f4fffb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)" id="t-avatar">A</div>
            <div class="quote">
              <p id="t-quote">“The session felt like a gentle map away from the noise — practical, clear, and quietly steady.”</p>
              <div class="meta"><span id="t-name">A. R.</span><span>—</span><span id="t-role">Participant</span></div>

              <div class="badge-row" id="cred-row" aria-hidden="false">
                <div class="cred-badge" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="Verified community partner — hosted 18 gatherings">
                  Community Host
                  <div class="tooltip">Verified community partner — hosted 18 gatherings</div>
                </div>
                <div class="cred-badge" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="Licensed facilitator: trauma-aware practice">
                  Trauma-aware
                  <div class="tooltip">Licensed facilitator: trauma-aware practice</div>
                </div>
                <div class="cred-badge" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="Local cooperative studio partner">
                  Studio Partner
                  <div class="tooltip">Local cooperative studio partner</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing comparator -->
        <div style="margin-top:18px">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Compare access</div>
            <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing cadence">
              <button id="cadenceMonthly" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
              <button id="cadenceSeries" role="tab">Series</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pricing" id="pricing">
            <div class="plan">
              <div style="font-weight:800">Explorer</div>
              <div class="price" data-monthly="24" data-package="80">$24</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Monthly or 3‑session package</div>
            </div>
            <div class="plan">
              <div style="font-weight:800">Anchor</div>
              <div class="price" data-monthly="44" data-package="150">$44</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">For regular attendees</div>
            </div>
            <div class="plan">
              <div style="font-weight:800">Deepen</div>
              <div class="price" data-monthly="88" data-package="299">$88</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Best value for ongoing work</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Numbers animate to reflect per-session monthly pricing or limited package rates. Toggle to preview.</div>

      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>&copy; <span id="year">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
    <div style="color:var(--muted)">Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Testimonials & rotating proof
    (function(){
      const tests = [
        {name:'A. R.', role:'Participant', text:'It settled the shoulders and opened a clearer rhythm to my day.'},
        {name:'S. M.', role:'Member', text:'Reliable sessions that let me notice what really matters, without rush.'},
        {name:'K. L.', role:'Therapist', text:'A careful practice—useful to recommend for clients wanting structure.'}
      ];
      let idx = 0;
      const quote = document.getElementById('t-quote');
      const nameEl = document.getElementById('t-name');
      const roleEl = document.getElementById('t-role');
      const avatar = document.getElementById('t-avatar');

      function render(){
        const t = tests[idx];
        quote.textContent = '“' + t.text + '”';
        nameEl.textContent = t.name;
        roleEl.textContent = t.role;
        avatar.textContent = t.name.split(' ').map(s=>s[0]).join('').slice(0,2);
      }

      document.getElementById('prevTest').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ idx = (idx-1 + tests.length)%tests.length; render(); reset(); });
      document.getElementById('nextTest').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%tests.length; render(); reset(); });

      let iID = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%tests.length; render(); }, 4500);
      function reset(){ clearInterval(iID); iID = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%tests.length; render(); }, 4500); }
      render();
    })();

    // Credibility badge tooltips: show tooltip on focus/hover via data-show
    (function(){
      const badges = document.querySelectorAll('.cred-badge');
      badges.forEach(b=>{
        b.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=>b.setAttribute('data-show','true'));
        b.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=>b.removeAttribute('data-show'));
        b.addEventListener('focus', ()=>b.setAttribute('data-show','true'));
        b.addEventListener('blur', ()=>b.removeAttribute('data-show'));
      });
    })();

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const btnMonthly = document.getElementById('cadenceMonthly');
      const btnSeries = document.getElementById('cadenceSeries');
      const prices = document.querySelectorAll('.price');
      let mode = 'monthly';

      function animateNumber(el, start, end){
        const formatter = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD',maximumFractionDigits:0});
        const duration = 500; //ms
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function frame(now){
          const t = Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/duration);
          const val = Math.round(start + (end-start) * t);
          el.textContent = formatter.format(val);
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(frame);
      }

      function setMode(m){
        mode = m;
        btnMonthly.classList.toggle('active', m==='monthly');
        btnSeries.classList.toggle('active', m==='package');
        btnMonthly.setAttribute('aria-selected', m==='monthly');
        btnSeries.setAttribute('aria-selected', m==='package');

        prices.forEach(p=>{
          const fromText = p.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'') || '0';
          const from = parseInt(fromText,10) || 0;
          const to = parseInt(p.getAttribute(m==='monthly'? 'data-monthly':'data-package'),10) || 0;
          animateNumber(p, from, to);
        });
      }

      btnMonthly.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMode('monthly'));
      btnSeries.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMode('package'));

      // Initial render: format anchors
      prices.forEach(p=>{
        const start = parseInt(p.getAttribute('data-monthly'),10) || 0;
        p.textContent = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD',maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(start);
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for the sound bath site

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html — Contact page with rotating Proof Gallery (testimonials + credibility badges with tooltips), a micro Pricing Comparator toggle (Monthly vs Series/package) with animated price numbers, an accessible contact form, and a contraindications notice.

Placeholders used (replace before publishing):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — business / program name
- {{TAGLINE}} — short tagline
- {{PHONE}} — phone number, used as tel: link
- {{EMAIL}} — contact email
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — main CTA label used across header and form
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — main CTA URL used for quick navigation
- {{CITY}} — city placeholder
- {{STATE}} — state placeholder

Integration notes:
- This chunk is intended as the contact page (contact.html) for the larger site. The header links assume sibling pages at /index.html, /events.html, /private-sessions.html, /pricing.html, /about.html, /faq.html, /book.html.
- The page references a pattern asset at assets/img/pattern.svg in the design brief. If you include that SVG, you can use it as a background in the header or panels.

Daring features implemented locally (no external CDN):
- Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials every 4.5s; has manual prev/next controls; credibility badges reveal tooltips on hover/focus.
- Pricing Comparator: toggle between Monthly and Series/package pricing; prices animate smoothly between values.

Accessibility and safety:
- Contraindications are included as a clear notice. This is not medical advice — modify wording if you bring the site into a clinical setting.
- The badge tooltips are keyboard-focusable.

Styling and assets:
- All styling is embedded in the HTML for portability. No external fonts or assets are required for operation, though adding a custom SVG pattern is recommended for visual richness.

How to test locally:
1. Place contact.html in your site folder alongside the other pages referenced in the header.
2. Replace placeholder tokens with real values.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. Test the testimonial rotation, tooltip hover/focus, and the pricing toggle.

Developer notes:
- The Pricing Comparator expects price values set as data-monthly and data-package on elements with class="price". These are integers (dollars) and will be formatted to USD during animation.
- Testimonials are defined inline in the script; for CMS integration, replace the array with dynamic data.

